{
  "slug": "token-saver",
  "name": "Token Saver",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automatically compresses verbose CLI output (git, docker, npm, terraform, kubectl, etc.) to save tokens in Claude Code sessions. 21 specialized processors with content-aware compression.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `token-saver-config` (Configure and diagnose token-saver compression settings)\n- **Commands** (1): `token-saver-stats` (Show token-saver compression statistics and savings)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install token-saver@claude-community` from `ppgranger/token-saver`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 1
  },
